  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_first_00",
      "hash64": "DD627A8DBA6EFA8F",
      "text": "Osu! Let’s do this![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_first_01",
      "hash64": "DD62798DBA6EF8DC",
      "text": "It’s the one, the only, the hot-blooded Dendra!\\nLet’s set our fighting spirits ablaze—together![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "34032E597B9C9561",
      "text": "Osu, new kid! So you’re the one who invited me\\nhere, huh?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "34032D597B9C93AE",
      "text": "A new challenge, in a new place... I’m all pumped\\nup and ready to get going![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "34032C597B9C91FB",
      "text": "But there must be a reason why you chose me\\nof all people to come all the way out here![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "34032B597B9C9048",
      "text": "Go on then—what d’ya need from me, new kid?![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "1C6E62F201B3B63D",
      "text": "I wanna see that hot-bloodedness!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "1C6E5FF201B3B124",
      "text": "I’d like for you to impart some wisdom!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_select_03",
      "hash64": "1C6E60F201B3B2D7",
      "text": "I just wanted to hang out",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "340332597B9C9C2D",
      "text": "I see! Well, you’ve got the right person, new kid!\\nThat’s my specialty!\\c\\nI’ll bring the ocean surrounding this school to a\\nnice boil with my hot-blooded battling![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 164,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_04b",
      "hash64": "FE0ADD0D0B1D9A3D",
      "text": "Oho! Looks like my battle studies wisdom is in\\ndemand here!\\c\\nGuess I shouldn’t be surprised, since this school\\nprioritizes battling so much![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_04c",
      "hash64": "FE0ADC0D0B1D988A",
      "text": "What’re you on about?! I came here for some\\ngood battling, not teatime and chats by the\\r\\nwater cooler![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "340331597B9C9A7A",
      "text": "In any case, I’ll do my best! Leave it to the\\nhot-blooded Dendra![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "340330597B9C98C7",
      "text": "Don’t worry, you’re in good hands! Like, a\\nHariyama’s hands! Y’know how tough those are![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "8D37EC72C2EDB86E",
      "text": "Hey, new kid! Man, that Terarium sure is\\nsomething![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "8D37ED72C2EDBA21",
      "text": "It’s kinda like the Blueberry version of our own\\nacademy’s schoolyard, huh?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "8D37EA72C2EDB508",
      "text": "All that open space is so liberating! It’s perfect\\nfor long-distance running![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "8D37EB72C2EDB6BB",
      "text": "For my next class, I’m thinking of having\\neveryone run a lap around the Terarium...\\r\\nWhat do you think?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "37A1D076C23731E0",
      "text": "Good idea!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "37A1D376C23736F9",
      "text": "I dunno...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "8D37F072C2EDBF3A",
      "text": "That’s right! It’s a great way to warm up before a\\nleg day workout. What could possibly go wrong?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_04b",
      "hash64": "E3CCEB0139FC2288",
      "text": "You’re right, it might be a bit much... Guess I’m\\njust itching to go for a run!\\c\\nOh well... OK, fine, just half a lap, then![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "8D37F172C2EDC0ED",
      "text": "So...I’ll see you there, right? Of course I will![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "36D2226B2783F7FF",
      "text": "Man, the students here sure are fired up![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "36D2216B2783F64C",
      "text": "Especially the kiddos taking battle studies.\\nThey’re always in the zone![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "36D2246B2783FB65",
      "text": "Y’know, I heard that you get more credits here\\nfor battle-related courses! Maybe that’s why\\r\\nthey’re so on top of their game?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "36D2236B2783F9B2",
      "text": "I mean, it makes sense! If you’re really good at\\nbattling, you’ve got a future as a ranger, as a pro\\r\\nTrainer, or working in the League![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "C4EEFAC9B85C331B",
      "text": "So many possibilities!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "C4EEFBC9B85C34CE",
      "text": "Wait, for real?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "36D21E6B2783F133",
      "text": "And of course, you could even become a battle\\nstudies instructor like yours truly![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_04b",
      "hash64": "AAFB011425330CA3",
      "text": "Oho! You didn’t know?!\\c\\nSo you became a Champion just because you\\ncould?! That’s true dedication to Pokémon![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "36D21D6B2783EF80",
      "text": "Well, battle studies or not, putting your best\\neffort into studying is important! A whole world\\r\\nof opportunities opens up for you if you do![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "36D2206B2783F499",
      "text": "Make the most of your time in school while you\\ncan, new kid![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "6BAD646D5CC72559",
      "text": "Ah, didn’t mean to get all preachy on you![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "6BAD636D5CC723A6",
      "text": "Y’know, I’m kinda curious about you, new kid—\\nas your teacher and fellow competitor![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "6BAD626D5CC721F3",
      "text": "I know! What do you say to trading Pokémon\\nso we can get to know each other better?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "coach_teacher_battle_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "6BAD616D5CC72040",
      "text": "All right! Let’s get started! I’ve got a Meditite!\\nWhat about you, new kid?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
